# Currency rules, Hindi. Same format as the other languages (see docs/recognizers.md).
#
# [currency.symbol]: form | ISO 4217 code | prefix, suffix or both | confidence (optional).
# [currency.name]:   forms, comma-separated | ISO 4217 code | value of one in the currency (optional) | confidence (optional).

[currency.symbol]
₹ | INR | both
Rs. | INR | prefix
Rs | INR | prefix
=Rs | INR | prefix
रु. | INR | prefix
रु | INR | prefix
$ | USD | both | 0.9
US$ | USD | prefix
€ | EUR | both
£ | GBP | both
¥ | JPY | both | 0.7
₺ | TRY | both

[currency.name]
रुपया, रुपये, रुपए, रूपये, रुपयों | INR | 1 | 0.95
पैसा, पैसे | INR | 0.01 | 0.5
डॉलर, डालर, डॉलरों | USD | 1 | 0.9
सेंट | USD | 0.01 | 0.5
यूरो | EUR | 1 | 0.95
पाउंड, पौंड | GBP | 1 | 0.8
येन | JPY
युआन | CNY
दिरहम | AED | 1 | 0.8
रियाल | SAR | 1 | 0.6

